407 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 343 0 R
/E (This course is a comprehensive journey through modern Data Science and AI, designed to take learners from Python programming basics all the way to next-generation Agentic AI systems. You will begin by mastering Python, statistics, and core machine learning techniques, then progress into deep learning, generative AI, RAG, and model lifecycle management with MLflow. You will also learn to build production APIs with FastAPI and process big data with PySpark for distributed computing. Finally, you will advance into LangGraph-based multi-agent systems, building a Multi-Agent System for Research Analysis and Generation Automation. By the end of this year-long program, you will be fluent in data analysis, ML, and DL, and understand how the world is moving towards autonomous AI systems that reason, retrieve, and collaborate.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
